---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="The idea | ChargeVia by Rangeway"
  description="Meet the idea behind ChargeVia by Rangeway: reliable fast charging at existing businesses with useful amenities and care for visitors.">
  <main id="main" class="detail-page shell">
    <header class="detail-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label">The idea</p>
        <h1>Good charging.<br />A useful stop.</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="detail-heading__intro">ChargeVia by Rangeway is being developed to bring reliable fast charging to places that already give you a reason to stop.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="editorial-story" aria-labelledby="stop-title">
      <figure class="concept-frame concept-frame--orange">
        <img src="/images/cv-urban-1440.webp"
          srcset="/images/cv-urban-640.webp 640w, /images/cv-urban-1440.webp 1440w"
          sizes="(min-width: 768px) 55vw, calc(100vw - 56px)"
          alt="Concept rendering of a vehicle charging beside a storefront in an urban setting"
          width="1440" height="803" fetchpriority="high" />
        <figcaption>Concept rendering. Amenities and layouts would vary by property.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="editorial-story__copy">
        <h2 id="stop-title">Make the stop count.</h2>
        <p>A coffee. Lunch. A restroom break. Charging should fit into the things you already need to do.</p>
        <p>We’re looking for existing retail, fuel, and hospitality properties with useful amenities, easy access, and people who care about the place.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="editorial-section" aria-labelledby="reliable-title">
      <header>
        <p class="section-label">The promise we’re building toward</p>
        <h2 id="reliable-title">The stop that<br />always works.</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="editorial-section__copy">
        <p class="editorial-lead">Reliability is the point.</p>
        <p>The aim is straightforward: charging you can count on, a property that’s cared for, and a useful way to spend the stop.</p>
        <p>Each location would have its own character. The care behind the charging experience should feel familiar.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rangeway-note" aria-labelledby="rangeway-title">
      <p class="section-label">By Rangeway</p>
      <div>
        <h2 id="rangeway-title">A charging stop with<br />people behind it.</h2>
        <p>ChargeVia is Rangeway’s host-site charging format. Rangeway would develop and manage the charging operation, alongside the businesses that make each stop useful.</p>
        <p class="concept-status">ChargeVia is in development. These images show the concept, rather than operating locations.</p>
        <a class="idea-link" href="/site-hosts">Have a place in mind? <span aria-hidden="true">»</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
